780		 * Whether the provider accepts per-tool `eager_input_streaming`.
781		 * When false, the Anthropic provider omits `tools[].eager_input_streaming`
782		 * and sends the legacy `fine-grained-tool-streaming-2025-05-14` beta header
783		 * for tool-enabled requests.
784		 * Default: true.
785		 */
786		supportsEagerToolInputStreaming?: boolean;
787		/** Whether the provider supports Anthropic long cache retention (`cache_control.ttl: "1h"`). Default: true. */
788		supportsLongCacheRetention?: boolean;
789		/**
790		 * Whether to send the `x-session-affinity` header from `options.sessionId`
791		 * when caching is enabled. Required for providers like Fireworks that use
