799		/**
800		 * Whether the provider supports Anthropic-style `cache_control` markers on
801		 * tool definitions. When false, `cache_control` is omitted from tool params.
802		 * Some Anthropic-compatible providers (e.g., Fireworks) do not support this
803		 * field on tools and may reject or ignore it.
804		 * Default: true.
805		 */
