964	const TURN_PREFIX_SUMMARIZATION_PROMPT = `The messages above are earlier context from an ongoing conversation. Later messages are stored separately and do not need to be reconstructed.
965	
966	Create a concise checkpoint of the user's request and the progress shown above. This checkpoint will be placed before the later messages so the conversation can continue with the necessary context.
967	
968	## Original Request
969	[What did the user ask for?]
970	
971	## Progress So Far
972	- [Key decisions and work completed in these messages]
973	
974	## Context Needed to Continue
975	- [Information from these messages needed to understand the later work]
976	
977	Only summarize information explicitly present above. Do not infer or recreate later messages.`;
